Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sex? Or shall we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Anyway, yesterday was a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A Turk with a big moustache came by,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming he was a rock musician who'd played in Motors in the 70s.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I blew it: forgot the band.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He made me crawl around with an ostrich
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,feather up my arse humming their big hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He sang it three times before I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he wanted to fuck my arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He hangs out at the station and the Bottom Bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,doing jobs for the Widow with Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Does piercings and tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two hang out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They asked me to be in their films.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've heard about their shoots, so no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Same with whatever else: cocks and feathers.
